"This property is used when you need multiple shared AMQP brokers.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_AMQP_DEVSERVICES_SERVICE_NAME+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr "[lock] `link:#quarkus-smallrye-reactivemessaging-amqp-config-group-amqp-dev-services-build-time-config_quarkus.amqp.devservices.service-name[quarkus.amqp.devservices.service-name]`"

